message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: mpc-iml-toolkit
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-16"
abstract: >-
  A base toolkit for interactive machine learning (IML) with an Akai MPC Sample
  and a Mac. It covers the shared plumbing of the IML loop: recording examples
  from the MPC pads over MIDI, training models with scikit-learn, running them in
  real time with output over OSC, and editing the examples to train again.
